        "ggBZIRfFwXD_text": "Unlock Peak Performance: Shilajit Shockwave – The Science-Backed Elixir for Energy &amp; Focus",
        "gg7qt1Fk4DX_text": "PrimaVie® Purified Shilajit",
        "gg81s992ldq_text": "(Asphaltum Punjabianum)<br>(50+ studies)",
        "ggTW2tsuB7-_text": "<p>The star of Shilajit Shockwave, this purified form of Shilajit has been clinically studied and shown to support energy production, enhance mitochondrial function, and aid in the body's response to stress. It's a powerhouse ingredient for unlocking your full potential.</p>",
        "gg29dYu3Ikg_text": "<p>The star of Shilajit Shockwave, this purified form of Shilajit has been clinically studied and shown to support energy production, enhance mitochondrial function, and aid in the body's response to stress. It's a powerhouse ingredient for unlocking your full potential.</p>",
        "ggRcT9KjdhD_text": "Panax Ginseng Extract",
        "ggfOaNAL8me_text": "(Korean Ginseng) (2,000+ studies)",
        "ggEND1ZE1G__text": "<p>A revered adaptogenic herb, Panax Ginseng is known for its ability to enhance cognitive function, improve mental clarity, and combat fatigue. It's your secret weapon for sharper focus and sustained energy.</p>",
        "ggU6vzkW34I_text": "<p>A revered adaptogenic herb, Panax Ginseng is known for its ability to enhance cognitive function, improve mental clarity, and combat fatigue. It's your secret weapon for sharper focus and sustained energy.</p>",
        "ggRD_GBOLf0_text": "Caffeine Extract",
        "ggu1H2utGfQ_text": "(10,000+ studies)",
        "ggNVE1x_nDr_text": "<p>A well-researched stimulant, caffeine blocks adenosine receptors in the brain, promoting alertness and wakefulness. It's your go-to for an immediate energy boost and improved physical performance.</p>",
        "ggs9YUZUTQo_text": "<p>A well-researched stimulant, caffeine blocks adenosine receptors in the brain, promoting alertness and wakefulness. It's your go-to for an immediate energy boost and improved physical performance.</p>",
        "ggCSLR-k5JK_text": "Tulsi Extract",
        "gg_cqQcQh1w_text": "(Holy Basil) (Ocimum Tenuiflorum) (500+ studies)",
        "ggrDKpi7NvN_text": "<p>This sacred herb is an adaptogen that helps the body adapt to stress and maintain balance. Studies suggest that Tulsi can reduce cortisol levels, the stress hormone, and promote a sense of calm and well-being.</p>",
        "gguou4buGRA_text": "<p>This sacred herb is an adaptogen that helps the body adapt to stress and maintain balance. Studies suggest that Tulsi can reduce cortisol levels, the stress hormone, and promote a sense of calm and well-being.</p>",
        "ggD95VjPDlB_text": "Peppermint Oil, Japan Mint Oil, Green Mint Oil, Menthe Glacuale",
        "ggwqOi25qwC_text": "(Frosted Mint) (10,000+ studies)",
        "ggqmv640foV_text": "<p>This invigorating blend of mint oils provides a refreshing, cooling sensation, and may enhance alertness and cognitive function. Their calming aromas can also help promote relaxation and reduce stress.</p>",
        "ggbeKibouW4_text": "<p>This invigorating blend of mint oils provides a refreshing, cooling sensation, and may enhance alertness and cognitive function. Their calming aromas can also help promote relaxation and reduce stress.</p>"
      }
