        "ggH3Z11_Xhc_text": "Frequently asked questions",
        "ggRHC6fQkMY_text": "Shilajit Shockwave - Supercharge Your Day with Natural Energy and Sharp Mental Clarity",
        "ggb7jdTkHgP_childItem_0": "<p>Conquer your day with renewed vigor and mental clarity.</p>",
