        "ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_2": "<p>HOW LONG DO THEY LAST?</p>",
        "ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_3": "<p>ARE THEY SAFE FOR ASTHMATICS?</p>",
        "ggBPrG0AB_o_text": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> A powerful way to impact your airways. Provides results you can feel. Effects are felt in seconds.</p>",
        "gg5W5gHQbeH_text": "<p><strong>Answer: </strong>Shilajit Shockwave is very strong. We recommend starting with just a few drops. Once you're accustomed to the experience, you may increase the dosage according to your liking.<br>For maximum effectiveness drop 1ml (a full dropper) in your mouth, swallow, and take a few deep breaths.</p>",
        "ggr10dL76E0_text": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can feel Shilajit Shockwave taking effect nearly instantly. The full performance benefits settle in over the course of 3-5 minutes and typically last 4-5 hours depending on the individual.</p>",
        "ggFS9EWWdaD_text": "<p><strong>Answer: </strong>Yes! We've had a lot of positive feedback from asthmatics and people with other breathing conditions utilizing Shilajit Shockwave. So far no contraindications have been reported.</p>"
      }
