        "section_preload": "true",
        "checksum": "dca0b8018483e8d1db9fb954dd26727989e87222772eb42d4c726502555e0b52_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggGoIi5pO5y_text": "Shilajit Shockwave - Supercharge Your Day with Natural Energy and Sharp Mental Clarity",
        "ggB8ifv4K6r_text": "<p>4.9/5*</p>",
        "ggOmnUG_P8M_text": "<p>1800+ reviews</p>",
        "ggF_ANOKK_1_text": "<p>Enhanced<br>Energy &amp; Focus</p>",
        "ggSfIO-Dzjy_text": "<p>Natural<br>Vitality &amp; Stamina</p>",
        "ggungsl1YXS_text": "<p>Adaptogenic<br>Stress Support</p>",
        "ggKC4pSXufP_text": "<p>I first saw Shilajit via social media, and i’m sure what any curious mind would do, is start either googling or youtubing the benefits before buying. I’m not the one to buy the cheapest stuff, if it’s legit and will almost be as close to a sure thing, then well i will give it a chance. A few months of taking it for males, you should notice your sex drive is improved. At least for me.</p>",
        "ggIBAJg2xCX_text": "H. Castillo, The Father of 3",
        "ggnAEA6DDaZ_text": "Shilajit Shockwave - Supercharge Your Day with Natural Energy and Sharp Mental Clarity",
        "ggaYr38UZCm_text": "<p>4.9/5*</p>",
        "gg9PUdmjb9V_text": "<p>1800+ reviews</p>",
        "ggHMvUzG5H0_text": "<p>Conquer your day with renewed vigor and mental clarity.</p>",
        "ggxfdXWVAvY_text": "<p>Stay calm and resilient in the face of life's challenges.</p>",
        "gg4tGcV02ca_text": "<p>Unlock your body's full potential for peak performance.</p>",
        "ggFPWWOvMYC_label": "GET MINE NOW",
        "ggFPWWOvMYC_outOfStockLabel": "Out of stock",
        "ggFPWWOvMYC_unavailableLabel": "Unavailable",
        "ggFDXwt8Wtx_text": "<p>For generations, the legendary power of Shilajit has enhanced vitality and well-being. Shilajit Shockwave, a meticulously crafted blend of this ancient superfood and adaptogenic botanicals, unlocks a new level of focus, energy, and resilience. Experience peak performance, mental clarity, and enduring calm, naturally.</p>",
        "gg_W53dclaK_childItem_0": "<p>Product Details</p>",
        "gg_W53dclaK_childItem_1": "<p>Science</p>",
        "gg_W53dclaK_childItem_2": "<p>Shipping &amp; Delivery</p>",
        "gg_W53dclaK_childItem_3": "<p>Return</p>",
        "gg_W53dclaK_childItem_4": "<p>How To Enjoy</p>",
        "ggJXhks1yA1_text": "<p>Shilajit Shockwave is a powerful, all-in-one elixir crafted to unlock your peak performance and well-being. Experience razor-sharp focus, sustained energy, and a calm resilience throughout your day – without the jitters or crashes.</p><p>Harness the ancient wisdom of Shilajit, a potent superfood revered for its revitalizing properties, combined with a synergistic blend of adaptogens and botanical extracts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Embrace Your Super, Natural Self</strong></p><p>Crafted with all-natural ingredients, Shilajit Shockwave is a delicious, invigorating elixir designed to seamlessly integrate into your daily routine. Simply administer the recommended dosage directly, making Shilajit Shockwave organic a hassle-free addition to your daily routine. Measure, release, and experience the wave of energy and focus that will carry you through your day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Your Journey to Peak Performance</strong></p><p>For optimal results, start by subscribing to Shilajit Shockwave for the ultimate convenience and long-term benefits. Consistency is key, so we recommend using Shilajit Shockwave for at least three months to unlock its full potential and achieve peak performance and vitality.</p>",
        "ggZgL9-AnXS_text": "<p>Shilajit Shockwave is meticulously formulated with a potent blend of scientifically-backed ingredients, each selected for its unique properties and synergistic effects:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1. PrimaVie® Purified Shilajit:</strong> This purified form of Shilajit, a mineral-rich substance found in the Himalayas, has been shown to enhance ATP production, a key molecule for energy production in cells. Clinical studies suggest PrimaVie® may improve exercise performance, reduce fatigue, and support cognitive function.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Panax Ginseng Extract:</strong> This adaptogenic herb has a long history of use for improving mental and physical performance. Studies indicate ginseng may enhance cognitive function, reduce stress, and boost the immune system.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Caffeine Extract:</strong> A well-known stimulant, caffeine can increase alertness, focus, and energy levels. Shilajit Shockwave utilizes a moderate dose of caffeine for a balanced energy boost without the jitters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. Tulsi Extract (Holy Basil):</strong> An adaptogen revered in Ayurveda, Tulsi has been shown to help the body adapt to stress, promote emotional well-being, and support a healthy immune response.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>5. Peppermint, Japan Mint, Green Mint, &amp; Menthe Glaciale (Frosted Mint) Oils:</strong> These mint oils offer refreshing and invigorating aromas, known for their potential to enhance mood, promote alertness, and ease tension. Some research suggests peppermint oil may even improve exercise performance and reduce fatigue.</p>",
        "ggoQaUscscl_text": "<p><strong>Synergistic Action:</strong></p><p>Shilajit Shockwave's unique blend of ingredients is designed to work synergistically, providing a comprehensive approach to enhancing energy, focus, and overall well-being. While each ingredient offers specific benefits, their combined effects create a powerful formula for peak performance and resilience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Scientifically Backed, Naturally Powered:</strong></p><p>Shilajit Shockwave is rooted in scientific research and utilizes natural ingredients to support your body's inherent potential. Experience the difference of a formula designed to elevate your mind, body, and spirit.</p>",
        "ggcZjNGedyq_text": "<p>All <strong>USA &amp; Australia</strong> orders arrives within 5 - 15 days.</p><p>All <strong>UK, Europe, Canada, Australia &amp; New Zealand</strong> orders arrive within 6-15 days.</p><p>Click <a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/policies/shipping-policy\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a> for more Shipping Policy.</p>",
        "ggTAxbWgqof_text": "<p>We have a 90-day return policy, which means you have 90 days after receiving your item to request a return.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To be eligible for a return, your item must be in the same condition that you received it, unopened and unused, with tags, and in its original packaging. You’ll also need the receipt or proof of purchase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To start a return, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@wellnessnest.co\">support@wellnessnest.co</a> for return instructions.</p>",
        "ggKA3Nnlbyc_text": "<p>1 serving = 1 drop</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For best results, take one serving of Shilajit Shockwave directly in the mouth in the morning or early afternoon. Measure, release, and experience the wave of energy and focus that will carry you through your day.</p>",
        "ggFa0Vs8lkT_text": "<p>Enhanced<br>Energy &amp; Focus</p>",
        "gg59nATKUei_text": "<p>Natural<br>Vitality &amp; Stamina</p>",
        "ggnQnYuR0Gh_text": "<p>Adaptogenic<br>Stress Support</p>",
        "ggPl4tvlQiW_text": "<p>I first saw Shilajit via social media, and i’m sure what any curious mind would do, is start either googling or youtubing the benefits before buying. I’m not the one to buy the cheapest stuff, if it’s legit and will almost be as close to a sure thing, then well i will give it a chance. A few months of taking it for males, you should notice your sex drive is improved. At least for me.</p>",
        "ggYzN5iq3ha_text": "H. Castillo, The Father of 3",
